                        <td valign=3D"top">
                           <p class=3D"oj-normal">(9)</p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign=3D"top">
                           <p class=3D"oj-normal">Den europeiska resehandli=
ngen f=C3=B6r =C3=A5terv=C3=A4ndande b=C3=B6r bidra till minskad administra=
